---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getDrafts } from '../site/drafts';
// `.card`, `.card-top`, `.stamp`, `.silent` and the `.mem`/`.offchain` rules
// are all in chain.css — imported here for the same reason every other route
// imports the styles it renders (see the note in WorkMeter.astro), so this
// page cannot ship unstyled. `.page-head` lives in base.css, which
// `Base.astro` always loads.
import '../styles/chain.css';

/**
 * §3.6 — the mempool: **drafts**, which are not in the chain at all.
 *
 * The one page on this site where the honest answer to "what is its hash?" is
 * that there isn't one. Everything around it is made of hashes, which is
 * exactly why nothing here may borrow their vocabulary: a draft has no hash,
 * no address, no gas, no value and no block, and `Draft`
 * (`src/site/drafts.ts`) carries no field that could pretend otherwise.
 *
 * The distinction this page exists to keep is the one §3.6 states outright —
 * a *pending* transaction is published, hashed and in the chain, waiting for
 * the next seal; it belongs to the open block on `/blocks`, and it is not a
 * draft. The prose below says so in as many words, because "mempool" in every
 * other explorer means the pending set, and a reader arriving with that
 * expectation will otherwise read this list as unconfirmed transactions.
 *
 * The empty list is the ordinary state, not an edge case: `content/drafts/`
 * ships empty and usually stays that way. It gets a sentence of its own rather
 * than a blank card, so the page reads as "nothing is waiting" instead of as a
 * page that failed to load.
 *
 * No clock (§14): `getDrafts()` reads a directory and the dates the files
 * declare.
 */
const drafts = getDrafts();
---

<Base title="Mempool — Blogchain" description="Bản nháp chưa đăng — chưa lên chuỗi.">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Mempool</h1>
    <span class="sub"><span class="num">{drafts.length}</span> bản nháp · chưa lên chuỗi</span>
  </div>

  <article class="card offchain" aria-label="Mempool">
    <div class="card-top">
      <span class="per">Bản nháp</span>
      <span class="stamp off">Ngoài chuỗi</span>
    </div>
    <p class="off-note">
      Đây là những bài đang viết, <strong>chưa lên chuỗi</strong>: không có hash, không có địa chỉ,
      không có gas, không có giá trị, không thuộc khối nào. Chuỗi chưa biết gì về chúng.
      Bài đã đăng nhưng chưa niêm phong thì đã nằm trong chuỗi rồi, ở khối đang mở trên
      trang <a href="/blocks">Blocks</a> — không phải ở đây.
    </p>
    {drafts.length > 0 ? (
      <ul class="mem">
        {drafts.map((draft) => (
          <li>
            {/* Plain text, never a link: a draft has no page, and giving it one
                would be the same claim as giving it a hash. */}
            <h2 class="t">{draft.title}</h2>
            <span class="d">{draft.date}</span>
            {/* The em dash the open block already uses for a field the chain
                has not committed to (`— chưa có, khối chưa đào` in
                BlockCard.astro) — here for every such field at once, because a
                draft has none of them. */}
            <span class="g">— chưa băm, chưa lên chuỗi</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    ) : (
      <p class="silent">Chưa có bản nháp nào trong mempool.</p>
    )}
  </article>
</Base>
